These 3 are most watched donghua IP whatever china or outside china. 

Ling cage is not even among top 40 watched donghua, how is it becomes contender for big 3?

@Lonnet_Official @Devalpple @animetrends 动画目前，修仙的， 凡人修仙传，将夜，剑来，都很不错。要看 还有光阴之外，牧神记，大道朝天也可以看看。其他可以 无视。

国漫双顶尖之一的 灵笼，这是科幻的。

另外还有 火凤燎原 也不错。

@pareen There's some cultural nuances that might not reach foreign watchers.
Ne Zha (1 and 2) grossed huge revenue but I doubt it's something that people outside China will enjoy much.
"Hi, Mom" is another one

@maihucinemaan I think Ramayan part 1 box office collection will be above 8000 crore 
